  "description": "A client for the spamc/spamd protocol, the HTTP-like request/response protocol SpamAssassin's scanning daemon speaks. Covers the full command set of protocol 1.5 - CHECK, SYMBOLS, REPORT, REPORT_IFSPAM, PROCESS, HEADERS, TELL, PING and SKIP - over any pair of streams, so the transport to a local or remote spamd stays the caller's choice.",
